#: {{ux|en|Carry on past the church and then '''bear''' left at the junction.}}
#: {{ux|en|By my readings, we're '''bearing''' due south, so we should turn about ten degrees east.}}
#: {{ux|en|Great Falls '''bears''' north of Bozeman.}}
